/**
 * Application extension point: create one isolated environment per worker.
 * Override startWorker(context), pollWorker(handle) and stopWorker(handle).
 * See testbox/system/parallel/README.md for lifecycle and result contracts.
 * The base class refuses execution until a provider is implemented; no shared
 * application scope or database is assumed safe for concurrent tests.
 */
class extends="testbox.system.parallel.WorkerProvider" {
}
